MoveDocumentToProject.description:
Cross-project subtree move (POST /api/documents/{id}/move).

parent_id resolves INSIDE target_project_id (None = target project root);
the command validates it with assert_parent_valid against the TARGET.

SkillFile.description:
One file attached by save_skill: `path` is the title the child document
gets (grammar SKILL_FILE_PATH_RE — no `..`, at most 3 segments);
`sandbox_path` is where the file sits in the caller's workspace.

put.description:
Upsert one instance_skills row by name — the three admin acts:

* a NEW skill (content with matching frontmatter name);
* an OVERRIDE of a shipped skill (content of the same frontmatter name —
  the UI copies the shipped body first);
* a TOMBSTONE (enabled=false over a shipped name, content stays null: the
  instance layer suppresses the shipped skill).
